### 1. API Gateway - Direct Text Analysis (Port 8000)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Hello, this is Michael from ABC Support. I just wanted to follow up and see if everything has been good since your purchase. If there's anything we can assist you with, we're happy to help. Should you need a refund, we'll guide you through every step. We never refund take your trust for granted. Thank you for being our valued customer."
}


### 2. API Gateway - Audio Processing (Port 8000)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/process-audio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA="
}


### 3. Whisper Speech-to-Text Service (Port 8001)
POST http://localhost:8001/transcribe/base64
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "audio_data": "UklGRiQAAABXQVZFZm10IBAAAAABAAEAQB8AAEAfAAABAAgAZGF0YQAAAAA="
}


### 4. Phrase Extraction Service (Port 8002)
POST http://localhost:8002/extract-phrases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transcript": "Hello, this is Michael from ABC Support. Should you need a refund, we'll guide you through every step. We never refund take your trust for granted."
}


### 5. Sentiment & Emotion Analysis Service - Single (Port 8003)
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isolated_sentence": "Should you need a refund, we'll guide you through every step.",
  "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
  "keyword_weight": 80.0
}


### 6. Sentiment & Emotion Analysis Service - Batch (Port 8003)
POST http://localhost:8003/analyze-sentiment-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "Should you need a refund, we'll guide you through every step.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "negative",
      "keyword_weight": 80.0
    },
    {
      "isolated_sentence": "Thank you for being our valued customer.",
      "keyword_sentiment": "positive",
      "keyword_weight": 90.0
    }
  ]
}
